hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2723","Narrated to us Muhammad bin Abd al-A'la, who said: Narrated to us Al-Mu'tamir, who said: I heard Abd al-Aziz, who is the son of Abu Rawwad, say: Nafi' narrated to me from Abdullah bin Umar (RA), who said: \The Prophet of Allah (ﷺ) would"","" whenever he circumambulated the House (the Ka'bah)"","" touch (or he said: kiss) the Black Stone and the Yemeni Corner in every circumambulation.\"""""""
